  {
    "id": "mixed-statistics",
    "kind": "mixed",
    "label": "Statistics",
    "text": "Let $x_1,\\ldots,x_n$ be observations. Their sample mean is $\\bar{x}=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^n x_i$. The number of observations is $n$.",
